    <h2>The tasks that need lead time, in the order they need it</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Passport and visa check</h3>
        <p>Expiration date, blank pages, and any visa requirements for your destination, checked first because these have the longest lead time to fix if there's a problem.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Travel insurance</h3>
        <p>A prompt to decide, not a nag. Some policies need to be bought within a window of the initial trip deposit to cover pre-existing conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Health and vaccinations</h3>
        <p>A space to note anything your destination requires or recommends, since some vaccines need weeks to become effective.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Logistics you'd forget</h3>
        <p>International phone plan or eSIM, pet or house sitting arranged, work coverage set up, so these aren't a scramble in the last few days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
